#   Group Vehicle APi

##  Fetch Vehicle Id  [/getVehicle{?access_token,is_vendor,size}]

### Fetch Vehicle Id [GET]

The api is used to get vehicle details based on its size

Request Body Parameters:
<table>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">access_token</td><td>string</td><td>access token of individual or corporate</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">is_vendor</td><td>number</td><td>It is fixed value set to 1</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">size</td><td>number</td><td>if the value is <code>0</code> then the vehicle type will be bike,if value is <code>1</code> then the vehicle type will be small, if value is <code>2</code> then the vehicle type will be medium,if value is <code>3</code> then the vehicle type will be large</td></tr>
</table>

+ Parameters
    + access_token - Enter access token here.
    + is_vendor    - Enter is vendor.
    + size         - Enter size for vehicle
    
+ Response 200 (application/json)
{
  "message": "Successful",
  "status": 200,
  "data": [
    {
