<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">loaders_amount</td><td>number</td> <td>Fetch the value from response of /send_payment_for_task api ,key loaders_amount.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">loaders_count</td><td>number</td> <td> Fetch the value from response of /send_payment_for_task api, key loaders_count. </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">delivery_instruction</td><td>string</td> <td>Fetch the value from response of /send_payment_for_task api, key delivery_instruction. </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">vehicle_id</td><td>number</td> <td>Fetch the value from response of /send_payment_for_task api , key vehicle_id. </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">delivery_images</td><td>string</td> <td> Fetch the value from response of /send_payment_for_task api ,key delivery_images. </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">is_cod_job</td><td> number </td><td> The value is 1 for collect on delivery task </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">surge_cost</td><td> number </td><td> The value is retrieved from /get_bill_breakdown api from key SURGE_PRICING </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">surge_type</td><td> number </td><td> The value is retrieved from /get_bill_breakdown api from key SURGE_TYPE </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">cash_handling_charges</td><td> number </td><td> The value is retrieved from /get_bill_breakdown api from key CASH_HANDLING_CHARGE </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">cash_handling_percentage</td><td> number </td><td> The value is retrieved from /get_bill_breakdown api from key CASH_HANDLING_PERCENTAGE </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">net_processed_amount</td><td> number </td><td> The value is retrieved from /get_bill_breakdown api from key NET_CASH_PROCEEDS </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">kwister_cash_handling_charge</td><td> number </td><td> The value is retrieved from /get_bill_breakdown api from key KWISTER_CASH_HANDLING_CHARGE </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">delivery_charge_by_buyer</td><td> number </td><td> The value is retrieved from /get_bill_breakdown api from key delivery_charge_by_buyer </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">delivery_charge</td><td> number </td><td> The value is retrieved from /get_bill_breakdown api from key DELIVERY_CHARGE </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">collect_on_delivery</td><td> number </td><td> The value is retrieved from /get_bill_breakdown api from key COLLECT_ON_DELIVERY </td></tr>
</table>

<br>

Response Body Parameters : 
<table>
<tr><td colspan="1"><strong>Name</strong><td colspan="1"><strong>Type</strong><td colspan="1"><strong>Description</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">message</td><td>string</td><tdThis says whether the request is successful or not></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">status</td><td>number</td><td>This should be mapped with the error codes mention in error codes section above.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">data</td><td>Object</td> <td>This gives the information about the task like pickup_tracking_link,delivery_tracing_link,job_id, job_token,
pickup_hash, delivery_hash</td></tr>
</table>

