## Cancel Task [/cancel_vendor_task]

### Cancel Task [POST]

This API is used to cancel the task by customer.
Request Body Parameters:

<table>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2"><strong>Name</strong><td><strong>Type</strong></td><td><strong>Description</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">access_token</td><td>string</td><td>access token of vendor</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">vendor_id</td><td>string</td><td>vendor id of vendor </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">job_id</td><td>string</td><td>You can get it from task details. (single or comma separated values)</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">job_status</td><td>number (fixed)</td><td>Set this value to “9” to start the task.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">domain_name</td><td>string</td><td>client web panel name </td></tr>
</table>

