## Delete card   [/delete_merchant_card]

### Delete merchant card [POST]

This API is used to delete card.

Request Body Parameters:
<table>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">access_token</td><td>string</td><td>access token of individual or corporate</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">card_id</td><td>string</td><td>fetch card_id from fetch merchant card api with key name card_id</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">payment_method</td><td>number</td><td>if the value is <code>8</code> the task payment type is cash,if value is <code>2</code> the task payment method is stripe if value is <code>32</code> the payment method is paystack,if value is <code>131072</code> then payment method is PAGA</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">domain_name</td><td>string</td><td> domain of client web panel</td></tr>

</table>


+ Request (application/json)

{
  "domain_name": "staging-client-panel.kwik.delivery",
  "access_token": "b5a12383b8281911e1cf9d7aceb14938",
  "payment_method": 32,
  "card_id": "1553261c7ab247e70dc77b1e24b7fcb5"
}

+ Response 200 (application/json)
{
  "message": "Successful",
  "status": 200,
  "data": {
    
  }
}

  
# Group Pricing Logic

## Calculate Pricing [/send_payment_for_task]

For calculating pricing the api used is send_payment_for_task . In this api calculations like service charge and charge according to google distances are calculated.

### Calculate Pricing  [POST]

<br>
Request Body Parameters:
<table class="humanColumnApiDescription markdown formalTheme">
<tr><td colspan="1"><strong>name</strong><td colspan="1"><strong>Type</strong><td colspan="1"><strong>Description</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">custom_field_template</td><td>string</td> <td> The name of template  mapped with customer , it will be provided by admin  <a href="https://dashboard.kwik.delivery/#/app/settings/apikey">click here</a> to get API key</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">access_token</td><td>string</td> <td> Access token of customer who is creating a task , it will be provided by kwik admin</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">domain_name</td><td>string</td> <td>Domain name is the domain of client panel , it will be provided by kwik admin</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">vendor_id</td><td>number</td> <td>It is id of customer , it will be privided by admin</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">auto_assignment</td><td>boolean</td> <td> If this value is <code>1</code> The task will be auto assigned to the members of the specific team mentioned. or if this value is <code>0</code> it will be unassigned task created. </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">layout_type</td><td> number </td><td>It is the vertical number which decides task flow , for kwik's platform it will always be 0 </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">pickup_custom_field_template</td><td>string</td><td> The name of template  mapped with customer , it will be provided by admin </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">has_pickup</td><td>number <br/>  </td><td>It determines if  the pickup is required , for kwik's platform it always will be 1  </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">has_delivery</td><td>number <br/> </td><td> It determines if  the delivery is required , for kwik's platform it always will be 1</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">is_multiple_tasks</td><td>number</td><td>It determines if multiple tasks are required(like in kwik's case signle pickup and single delivery), for our platform it will be 1</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">user_id</td><td>number <br/></td><td> The id of the admin</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">payment_method</td><td>number <br/></td><td> There are 4 payment methods supported in kwik 8: Cash on pickup , 32: Card payment , 262144 : Cash on delivery ,131072 : Paga </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">form_id</td><td>number</td><td> The id of for mapped with customer , it will be provided by kwik's admin</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">is_schedule_task</td><td>number</td> <td>The values are 0 or 1 , 0 is for the normal task and 1 is for the scheduled task </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">pickups</td><td>JSON Array</td> <td> The array of pickup details </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">pickups[0].address</td><td>json array</td> <td>This address of pickup</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">pickups[0].email</td><td> string <br/> </td><td>  The email of pickup , it is the email of the customer</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">pickups[0].phone</td><td>String <br/> </td> <td> The phone no of pickup , it is the phone no of the customer </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">pickups[0].latitiude</td><td> String </td><td> The latitiude no of pickup </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">pickups[0].longitude</td><td>String </td><td> The longitude no of pickup</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">deliveries</td><td>JSON Array</td> <td> This is array of delivery details </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">deliveries[0].address</td><td>string</td> <td>This address of delivery</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">deliveries[0].email</td><td> string <br/> </td><td>  The email of delivery , it is the email of the customer</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">deliveries[0].phone</td><td>String <br/> </td> <td> The phone no of delivery , it is the phone no of the customer </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">deliveries[0].latitiude</td><td> string </td><td> The latitiude no of delivery </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">deliveries[0].longitude</td><td>string </td><td> The longitude no of delivery</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">deliveries[0].has_return_task</td><td>boolean </td><td> The values can be true or false , true if the return task is available and false if not available</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">is_loader_required</td><td>number</td> <td>If this value is <code>1</code> it means loader is required and if the value is<code>0</code>it means loader is not required.in case the response from /getLoaders api gives is_loaders_enabled = 0 then one cannot use loaders for that job.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">loaders_amount</td><td>number</td> <td>If this value of is_loader_required is <code>1</code> it means loader is required then you have to specify the total cost of loaders that can be fetch using /getLoaderList api according to count of loaders ,and if the loader is not required you can 0 value</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">loaders_count</td><td>number</td> <td> If this value of is_loader_required is <code>1</code> it means loader is required then you have to specify the count of loaders that can be fetch using /loaders api according to one's requirement ,and if the loader is not required you can 0 value </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">delivery_instruction</td><td>string</td> <td>You can specify any instruction for the delivery person </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">vehicle_id</td><td>number</td> <td>You can specify vehicle id depending on the size of vehicle required.You can fetch the id from the  response of /getVehicle api mentioned above </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">delivery_images</td><td>string</td> <td> If you need to provide any pictures for the delivery item you can send the url for the same </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">is_cod_job</td><td>number</td> <td>The values are 0 or 1 , 0 is for the normal task and 1 is for the collect on delivery task </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-right: 40px; width: 140px;">parcel_amount</td><td>number</td> <td>If the value for is_cod_job is 1 then specify the consignment amount </td></tr>


</table>


