## Get Estimated Fare   [/get_bill_breakdown]

### Get breakdown of pricing  [POST]

This API is used to get Estimated Fare for Task.

Request Body Parameters:
<table>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">access_token</td><td>string</td><td>access token of individual or corporate</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">benefit_type</td><td>number</td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">amount</td><td>string</td><td> amount is fetched from send_payment_for_task from key per_task_cost</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">insurance_amount</td><td>string/td><td>is fetched from send_payment_for_task api from key name insurance_amount</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">total_no_of_tasks</td><td>number</td><td> is fetched from send_payment_for_task api from key name total_no_of_tasks.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">user_id</td><td>number</td><td> it is id for admin which is to be provided to third party</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">form_id</td><td>number</td><td> it is to be provided to third party,it appears in login api,can be hardcoded because it don’t change on every login..It will be always 2</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">promo_value</td><td>number</td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">domain_name</td><td>string</td><td> domain of client web panel</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">credits</td><td>number</td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">total_service_charge</td><td>string</td><td>is fetched from send_payment_for_task api from key name total_service_charge</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">is_loader_required</td><td>number</td> <td>Fetch the value from response of /send_payment_for_task api ,key is_loader_required.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">loaders_amount</td><td>number</td> <td>Fetch the value from response of /send_payment_for_task api ,key loaders_amount.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">loaders_count</td><td>number</td> <td> Fetch the value from response of /send_payment_for_task api, key loaders_count. </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">delivery_instruction</td><td>string</td> <td>Fetch the value from response of /send_payment_for_task api, key delivery_instruction. </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">vehicle_id</td><td>number</td> <td>Fetch the value from response of /send_payment_for_task api , key vehicle_id. </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">delivery_images</td><td>string</td> <td> Fetch the value from response of /send_payment_for_task api ,key delivery_images. </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">is_cod_job</td><td>number</td><td>The value is 0 if it is normal task and 1 if it is collect on delivery order</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">parcel_amount</td><td>number</td><td>The consignment value</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">delivery_charge_by_buyer</td><td>number</td><td>The value is 1 if delivery charge is paid by buyer and 2 if delivery charge is paid by kwik customer</td></tr>
