# Group Corporate End Of month billing logic

## Add corporate   [/customer/add]

### Add corporate [POST]

This API is used to add corporate.

Request Body Parameters:
<table>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">address</td><td>string</td><td>address of company</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">domain</td><td>string</td><td>domain of client web pane</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">email</td><td>string</td><td>email of corporate</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">first_name</td><td>string</td><td>first name of manager of corporate</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">last_name</td><td>string</td><td>last name of manager of corporate</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">name</td><td>string</td><td>name of manager of corporate</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">default_pickup_latitude</td><td>string</td><td>default pickup latitude of corporate</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">default_pickup_longitude</td><td>string</td><td>default pickup longitude of corporate</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">default_pickup_address</td><td>string</td><td>default pickup addres of corporate</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">latitude</td><td>string</td><td>latitude of address</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">longitude</td><td>string</td><td>longitude of address</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">password</td><td>string</td><td>password</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">user_type</td><td>number</td><td>fixed <code>1</code> for customer</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">form_ids</td><td>number</td><td>fixed value <code>-1</code></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">customer_type</td><td>number</td><td>if value <code>1</code> then it is corporate otherwise individual</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">company_rc_number</td><td>string</td><td>rc number of a company</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">is_master_admin</td><td>number</td><td>if value <code>1</code> then it is master admin otherwise sub corporate </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">phone</td><td>string</td><td>phone of individual or corporate</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">sla_id</td><td>number</td><td>sla are selected on the basis of eta and rating of agent to which request is to be send</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">is_monthly_invoice</td><td>number</td><td>if value<code>1</code> is enabled else disabled</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">monthly_invoice_date</td><td>string</td><td>date of start of monthly invoice i.e current date </td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">access_token</td><td>string</td><td>Access token of admin</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">is_surge_enable</td><td>number</td><td>if value<code>1</code> is enabled and if <code>2<code> then disabled</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">is_kfleet_enable</td><td>number</td><td>if value<code>1</code> is enabled and if <code>0<code> then disabled</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">is_api_enabled</td><td>number</td><td>if value<code>1</code> is enabled and if <code>0<code> then disabled</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding-left: 0;" colspan="2">is_cod_customer</td><td>number</td><td>if value<code>1</code> is enabled and if <code>0<code> then disabled</td></tr>

</table>


